{"root":{"data":{"id":"dmlg76uytt40","created":1793696095961,"text":"GPS 卫星信号的产生、\n调制、传播与接收机解调原理"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmlgm0hfmsg0","created":1793697257545,"text":"标称基准频率","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmlgmdbkigo0","created":1793697285488,"text":"10.23 MHz","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmlgo3m561s0","created":1793697421088,"text":"调制","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmlgo66r0oo0","created":1793697426688,"text":"幅度调制 AM","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmlgzwsrd0o0","created":1793698346621,"text":"改变载波振幅","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmlgo955ylc0","created":1793697433122,"text":"频率调制 FM","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmlh01crrvk0","created":1793698356538,"text":"改变载波频率","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmlgob529sw0","created":1793697437470,"text":"相位调制 PM","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmlh05ht4gg0","created":1793698365550,"text":"改变载波相位","layout":null},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmlgp0mn1v40","created":1793697492952,"text":"BPSK（Binary Phase Shift Keying，二进制相移键控）","font-weight":"bold","layout":null,"expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmlgrndf1b40","created":1793697699189,"text":"假设要发送两个数字：0 和 1。\nBPSK 可以用两个相差 180° 的载波相位状态来表示它们。","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmlgrvfcecg0","created":1793697716719,"text":"将正弦载波乘以 −1，相当于将它的相位翻转 180°","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmlgs0ia0480","created":1793697727781,"text":"卫星并不是把数字 0、1 作为独立的电磁波发送，\n而是通过控制载波在某些时刻是否翻转相位，让接收机能够恢复这些数字","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmlgsmvqau80","created":1793697776483,"text":"PRN 伪随机测距码","font-weight":"bold","expandState":"expand","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmlgsti1fc00","created":1793697790893,"text":"Pseudo-Random Noise，伪随机噪声码","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmlh32fd23k0","created":1793698593964,"text":"GPS L1 C/A 使用的 C/A 码是一种专门设计的 PRN 序列，传统上使用 Gold 码构造。","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmlh36bqfds0","created":1793698602452,"text":"它看起来像随机的 0、1 序列，但实际上完全由确定的规则生成。","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmlh3d0o8480","created":1793698617020,"text":"Chip（码片）","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmlh3j8nexs0","created":1793698630563,"text":"Chip 和 Bit 很像，都是二值符号，但用途不同：\nBit：通常表示要传输的信息比特。\n\nChip：表示扩频码中的一个符号。","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmlh46iykj40","created":1793698681253,"text":"C/A 码每 1 ms 重复一次，且不同卫星使用不同的指定 PRN 序列。接收机事先知道这些序列的生成规则。","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmlh4z1ske00","created":1793698743341,"text":"为什么要发送 PRN 码？","expandState":"expand","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmlh4yxr42w0","created":1793698743097,"text":"原因一：让接收机识别不同卫星。","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmlh5pcbcps0","created":1793698800574,"text":"GPS 卫星可以在同一个 L1 频率上同时发送信号。\n即使多颗卫星的信号在接收天线处叠加，接收机也能利用不同 PRN 码的相关特性区分它们。\n这种技术称为：\nCDMA（Code Division Multiple Access，码分多址）。","layout":null},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmlh53tdk7s0","created":1793698753716,"text":"原因二：测量信号的时间延迟。","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmlh7k93zug0","created":1793698946225,"text":"接收机也能在本地生成同样的序列。\n因为信号传播需要时间，接收到的码序列相对于接收机的本地时间基准存在延迟。\n接收机逐渐移动本地码的时间位置，并比较两段序列的相似程度，就可以估计接收信号的码相位。","layout":null},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmm1c14yjkw0","created":1793755718634,"text":"相关运算（Correlation）"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmm1c5yqlm80","created":1793755729141,"text":"注意：单个 C/A 码片对应约 293 m 的距离，并不意味着 GPS 测距精度只能达到 293 m。接收机通过相关峰跟踪与插值等方法，可以实现远小于一个码片宽度的测量分辨率。"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmm1djmtke00","created":1793755837260,"text":"生成导航电文","font-weight":"bold"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmm1dotscko0","created":1793755848565,"text":"GPS 地面控制段负责监测卫星、计算轨道和时钟参数，并向卫星上传导航数据。卫星按照规定的电文格式将这些数据广播给用户。"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmm1eckayvs0","created":1793755900234,"text":"导航电文比特变化很慢，PRN 码变化很快"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmm1efhebcg0","created":1793755906589,"text":"扩频和载波调制","font-weight":"bold","layout":null},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmm1lfxx96w0","created":1793756456137,"text":"卫星端已经准备好了三种东西：\nL1 载波：1575.42 MHz。\nC/A 码：1.023 Mchip/s。\n导航电文：50 bit/s。","layout":null},"children":[]}]}]},"template":"right","theme":"fresh-blue-compat","version":"1.4.43"}